Frequency: Per return + scheduled PM
Volume: ~200–800 container moves/month × return-handling
Owner: Fleet/Logistics (VS-06) / Property Manager
Participants: Logistics (VS-06), Facilities (VS-138), Property Manager, Procurement (VS-34), Finance (VS-35)
Source: workflow W5053 — Portable Container Fleet Maintenance, Cleaning, Sanitization &amp; Lifecycle</bpmn:documentation>
