      <bpmn:userTask id="W5053_Task5" name="Receive &amp; inspect returned containers: check structural integrity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Receive &amp; inspect returned containers: check structural integrity (doors/lock-box/floor/wind-water-tight), damage (links W5046), and quarantine damaged units
Responsible (R): Logistics / Facilities
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: Per return</bpmn:documentation>
