        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Build the storage KPI model: physical &amp; economic occupancy, street-vs-in-place rate, RevPAU, tenant lifetime value (LTV), acquisition cost (CAC), delinquency %, bad-debt %, churn
Responsible (R): Analytics / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Director Storage
