        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Drive action: feed insights to yield (W5039), pricing (W5035), marketing/retention (VS-14), and program strategy (W5056); close-the-loop with FP&amp;A (VS-17.4)
Responsible (R): Analytics / Director Storage / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Director Storage
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
