    <bpmn:process id="W_W5056" name="W5056. Storage Program Performance, ROI &amp; Cross-Sell/Basket-Linkage Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Executive review; annual strategy (W5033); program maturity assessment
Frequency: Quarterly/annual
Volume: 1 program × all sites
Owner: Director Storage / FP&amp;A (VS-17.4)
Participants: FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), Analytics (VS-28), Strategy (VS-33), Marketing (VS-14), Store Ops (VS-07)
Source: workflow W5056 — Storage Program Performance, ROI &amp; Cross-Sell/Basket-Linkage Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5056_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5056_Lane1" name="FP&amp;A">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5056_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5056_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5056_Lane2" name="Analytics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5056_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5056_Lane3" name="Director Storage">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5056_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5056_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5056_Start5" name="Executive review; annual strategy (W5033); program maturity assessment">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5056_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5056_Task6" name="Measure program ROI: NOI, capex payback, recurring-revenue contribution, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Measure program ROI: NOI, capex payback, recurring-revenue contribution, and the program P&amp;L vs business case (W5033)
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A / Analytics / Director Storage
Accountable (A): Director Storage / CFO
Duration: Quarterly/Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5056_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5056_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5056_Task7" name="Quantify cross-sell/basket-linkage: storage-tenant merchandise attach…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Quantify cross-sell/basket-linkage: storage-tenant merchandise attach (VS-143/VS-162 large items), renovation-basket linkage, and trade-pro storage usage (VS-43); measure dwell/basket lift
Responsible (R): Analytics / Marketing / Store Ops
Accountable (A): Director Storage
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5056_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5056_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5056_Task8" name="Recommend &amp; steer: site expansion/pause/exit, pricing/yield adjustments…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Recommend &amp; steer: site expansion/pause/exit, pricing/yield adjustments (W5039), and portfolio rebalancing — feeding the strategy cycle (W5033) and capital plan (VS-35/VS-40)
Responsible (R): Director Storage / Strategy / FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): Director Storage / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5056_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5056_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5056_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5056_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5056_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-754 (ensure controlled execution — Storage Operations, Maintenance, Safety &amp; Analytics (PA-174.3).) | - CTL-754: program P&amp;L reconciled to FP&amp;A (VS-17.4); capex within VS-35/VS-40 envelope; cross-sell measured consistently
Owner: Director Storage / FP&amp;A (VS-17.4)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
